Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次这么清静 感觉都好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴去晨练跑步了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼去观测飞机了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶今天开始要在唯美着迷打工
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1150,970)}Pretty Holic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:31.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶去马术俱乐部了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都卯足了劲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.23,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,臻白！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:41.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是画本 我们一起看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:49.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,经历过种种 两个人能够幸福地生活下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可贺 可喜可贺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.74,0:00:53.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《灰姑娘》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《桃太郎》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这本也要看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:58.16,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,发生过这样的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:03.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可贺 可喜可贺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:04.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《将军盖帽猫的冒险》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:05.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:08.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一边说 一边逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:10.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可贺 可喜可贺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《小鬼的生日》《浦岛太郎》《龟兔赛跑》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:11.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 都读了10本了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,读嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:22.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你都说读了 来几本就读几本吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}真白的梦想 最初的一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,给公主读了那么多画书吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喉咙都有点哑了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学太温柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,温暖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:17.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看到人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:23.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:24.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哟！大伙都来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:30.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华 你学习已经很忙了 还要打工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有在强撑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:36.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,没有！我早就想来这里打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:39.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不要太开心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:44.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 别太操心了 你又不是老妈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这话应该我说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这是新款的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的颜色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:57.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 涂上这个色 活力就能不输给夏季耀眼的太阳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美妙的评价啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 菜摘姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小蝶的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得经常来逛我们店呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:08.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:14.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白是这里的老粉丝了 所以致使我也会经常来逛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,唯美着迷是我的治愈圣地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,菜摘姐是我打工上的前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:25.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正在上美院... 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我在学习绘画
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 小白妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮我参考一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:33.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:34.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部分总觉得缺少一点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白妹妹是我们的老粉了 应该能想出点好主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这副画是菜摘姐画的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美... 仿佛是人鱼居住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人鱼？或许效果会不错！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:02.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这么短时间 一下子就画好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这画得太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:08.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,给人一种使用了新款化妆品 就能化身人鱼的感觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要有小白妹妹这种资质
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能得心应手地画出画书了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你说... 画书吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在挑战那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市大家的画书大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是进展不太顺利...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 小白妹妹要不要也试试看？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 不行的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 不是挺有趣的嘛！小白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}家居中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,创作画书...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:42.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要我参加吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:49.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学为我们做的云面包 可感动我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像菜摘姐说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:55.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学应该是有资质这样东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:56.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿 有吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:02.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看真白同学画的画书呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:04.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 这是我单方面的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我就尝试挑战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,画画！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:18.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 那个跟画书没什么关系呢 想要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:27.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:33.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在这里玩了 真白加油创作画书吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:35.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要构思故事...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:47.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 很久很久以前...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,山里的小溪缓缓流淌...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:56.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,漂过来一只很大 很大的桃子...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:00.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 这不就是桃太郎吗 而且好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 不是桃子...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:06.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,从小溪上游... 漂来一只南瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,从里面蹦出一位漂亮的小姑娘...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:12.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 这成灰姑娘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而且跟桃太郎混到一起了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个姐姐好像在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:25.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我就是不行的吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,完全想不出故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:31.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也画不出那么精美的画...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:34.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底 我哪有什么资质...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:41.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我替你做主意 好像让真白同学困恼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 你能夸奖我 我挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:51.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是... 我没有大家那样 想要从事某种职业的梦想...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:57.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:08:02.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还是认为真白同学保持现在这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:04.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你不要去在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你 小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:11.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 借一个给人家不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:16.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主的意思是 “绝对... 不借”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:20.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这么小心眼 长大了可不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要友好相处哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:37.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我说啊 用小空你最喜欢的玩具\N\N跟小朋友一起玩的话 肯定会更开心的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:40.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:47.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家孩子给你们添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:04.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还远不成熟啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:07.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道训斥小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:15.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而真白同学却在教导小空要有一颗友善的心...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:18.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这回事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,结果 小空也没有明白这个道理...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 读嘛 读嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《浦岛太郎》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的好的 我们从上次的地方接着读
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙宫城 那是一座宏伟美丽的城池
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城里的公主盛情款待了太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:47.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:48.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:51.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我先回去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:52.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白... 她有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等着我 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:21.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 从白天开始就一直在画画书？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 都这么沉浸其中了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是第一次看见真白那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.01,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（壶哨声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:36.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,水开了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:41.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学没有在勉强自己吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,来 小晴 这个拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你去看看小白的情况吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:57.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 我拿茶来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:17.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻地...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:25.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不知怎么的... 心里好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,画好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 要赶快了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:10.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哦哟 挺急的样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:15.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是要办什么重要的事情吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,截稿是在什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在5点前交到市民中心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,时间还早 没问题的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:32.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:40.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵 那个资料袋装的 是很重要的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:42.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,与你无关！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:45.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可担心你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:51.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怕你们遇上什么事故 怕你们把那资料袋掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:54.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:05.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 偏偏在这个时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个讨厌的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
