Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,给我上 乱暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:18.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,信号灯是保护行人的工具！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:23.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,饶不了你用来捣乱的行为！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:29.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:30.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶扑击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,身体不能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,连乱暴兽也停下了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:55.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:56.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:02.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:02.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:06.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:11.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,红灯的时候 就不能动了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:16.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等到绿灯就能动了 只是我们掌握不了时机...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:18.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:23.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:26.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,继续纠缠下去 就赶不上画书的截稿时间了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要管那个了 想办法净化乱暴兽...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:33.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:38.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism 等下一次绿灯的时候 你什么都别想 只管往前冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 那是你努力的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 现在情况紧急...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:44.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你只管去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:48.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism的温柔 总是在背后扶持着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那么今天 就让我们为你助威！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:01.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,美丽啊... 多么珍贵的友情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:03.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 你们无须烦恼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,与其毫无成果的逐个击破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我就把你们一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧 乱暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了... Sky 准备上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:16.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,二色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,守护的力量飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:42.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:43.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,停住她！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:45.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:51.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:52.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好！这样就没法用红灯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！你快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一记 绿灯行拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,960)}Let's GO Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,神采飞扬地上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:16.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:24.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:24.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:34.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:19:00.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·绚烂彩虹冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:19:00.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔镜平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:21.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
