Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:30.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么会一次次输给 这么弱的家伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:37.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄绝对不会输给 你这种只会惹人厌的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:39.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,行 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底打垮你们的乐趣 我就留到下次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:49.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（钟声）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！搞定了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:03.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,当然！小白呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:06.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,压线赶上了 投稿成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市大家的画书大赛展览会场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}大奖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯美着迷的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:27.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是菜摘姐的 太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.57,0:20:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白妹妹的画书也很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望以后我也能创作出 那种温情的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,菜摘姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:47.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！这是真白同学的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz8.619\pos(828,845)}{\fs50}《刺毛豪猪》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\frx180\fry180\frz6.084\pos(610,367)}{\fs50}《北极熊的暑假》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fad(0,500)}《秋千》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:56.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小姑娘在森林里发现了大大的秋千
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,荡啊荡 荡啊荡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候 来了一个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:05.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:07.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:11.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小姑娘和小男孩一起荡起了秋千
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:19.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里的动物们 一个接一个都过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:24.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家齐心协力 不断地推动秋千...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:29.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了远方那大大的彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都说 好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:35.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家已经是好朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:40.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:42.95,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学就是厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然没有入选大赛...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:54.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我以后也要尝试多创作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:22:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}虹丘真白 作品《秋千》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:59.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,画出能够传达到小空 传达到小朋友心里的画书...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Melody！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,970)}旋律愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:11.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 和我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,奏响音乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Let's play！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:47.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起外出玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:50.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 还有在养护菜田的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:53.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像还是第一次采摘蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:57.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 奶奶急着要出门 还真是少见呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:23:59.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:00.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:00.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雄阔振翅！知识之翼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:25.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:30.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.18,0:01:36.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:44.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:49.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:53.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:55.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:04.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:05.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:10.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:14.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:17.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:19.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:19.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:25.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:30.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:35.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:40.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:43.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:51.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:34.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:37.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:46.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:48.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:51.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:55.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:02.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:08.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:15.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:19.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:25.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:33.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:37.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:38.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:41.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
